From: Amandeep Singh <amanr268@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:35:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Kernel: 6 patches for a clean boot log; power button: hold 5
 s to power off

- kernel/patches: fix the clkdev name-length bug in ti-sysc and stop
  logging harmless start-up steps as errors (voltage domains, wkup_m3
  deferral, rtc-only, EDMA debugfs, sync-state-only device links)
- config/logind-aqm-power.conf: a short tap is ignored, a 5 s hold
  powers off. A glitch on the button line powered the board off at
  04:17 on 2026-11-23.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FevFi6EsoDgsQbJXyzXSq8
